      "type": "textEditor",
      "data": {
        "value": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><strong>Direct immunofluorescence (DIF)</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><strong>Clinical History : </strong>Nephrotic range proteinuria, ANA-negative, C3/C4-normal, r/o Podocytopathy.</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://radiology-flabs.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/35f182c4c7fe2736c553.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"575\" height=\"184\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><strong>Gross : </strong>1. Received 1 linear tissue core measuring 1.1 cm for DIF studies.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><strong>DIF :</strong> Following immunostaining pattern is observed in sampled 4 glomeruli:</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><strong>RESULTS-&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 50%;\"><col style=\"width: 50%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">PARAMETER</span></strong></td>\n<td><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">RESULT</span></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">IgA&nbsp;</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Negative</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">IgG</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">3+ capillary wall granular</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">IgM</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Negative</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">C3&nbsp;</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Negative</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">C1q</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Trace-1+ capillary wall granular</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Kappa light chains&nbsp;</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">3+ capillary wall granular</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Lambda light chains</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">3+ capillary wall granular</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><strong>Commments :</strong> Kindly correlate with clinical profile, systemic findings, serum PLA2R levels etc and light&nbsp;microscopic findings.</span></p>",
        "field": "textEditor"
      },
      "_id": "687f1f6bbfa7257dddc295e4"
    }
